WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Step 1: In Google Analytics open Admin, then Account access management.

2
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Step 2: Click the blue plus at the top right.

3
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Step 3: Choose Add users.

4
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Step 4: Paste the agent's email from your centre card into Email addresses.

5
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Step 5: Choose Editor and untick Notify new users. Editor lets the agent build your measurement.

6
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Step 6: Click Add.

7
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:46.000
Step 7: Your card shows the exact email to add.

8
00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:53.000
Step 8: Leave Property ID empty and click Connect. The agent finds the property for your website.
